  "version": "0.3.0",
  "author": "NoteGoblin example",
  "description": "An example homebrew pack: the Jujutsu Sorcerer class with Cursed Energy, Innate Techniques (Limitless, Ten Shadows), Domain Expansion, cursed tools and a Cursed Energy Output stat.",
